# RealmsRPG Project

**Stack:** Next.js App Router, React, Tailwind, Supabase, Vercel. No Prisma. Schema: `SUPABASE_SCHEMA.md`.

**Dirs:** `src/app/`, `src/components/{ui,patterns,...}/`, `src/hooks/`, `src/stores/`, `src/lib/`, `src/services/`.

**Agent OS:** `ARCHITECTURE_CONSTITUTION.md` · work from **ClickUp** (only queue) · SoT map in root `AGENTS.md`.

**Workflow:** [Realms Dev Workflow & Agent Rules](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1F6iZUKP9nN0YTFzOkZ6Y82sySaw0iW101f_a-7ZeQdI/edit) (Drive SoT).

**Git rules:** **Never push directly to `master`**; every change goes through a PR. Branch naming: `bug|feat/<clickUpId>-short-slug`. Include the ClickUp task ID in the branch name and the PR. Before PR: `npm run build` + `npm run tasks:validate`. `related_files` paths must exist. UI gates: lint/contrast/build + visual/a11y.
